* 20-crystal-xfmr.lib - crystal resonator with ports on continuation lines, and a coupled transformer
* SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0
* Written for the Omnia P0.3 spike. Generic parameters, no vendor data.
.SUBCKT XTAL_GENERIC
+ 1 2
+ PARAMS: FS=32.768k Q=50k C0=1.5p CM=3f
LM 1 3 {1/((6.2832*FS)**2*CM)}
CM 3 4 {CM}
RM 4 2 {1/(6.2832*FS*CM*Q)}
C0 1 2 {C0}
.ENDS
*
.subckt XFMR_1TO2 p1 p2 s1 s2
LP p1 p2 1m
LS s1 s2 4m
K1 LP LS 0.999
.ends XFMR_1TO2
